"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "Used to capture on-site photos and evidence footage. Originals are kept in the app; while \"Also save to the system album\" is on (the default), a copy also goes to your photo library. You can turn this off in Settings.";
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "Used for on-site audio evidence and for sound in video recordings. Recorded audio is kept only as an evidence record.";
"NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "Records where each capture was taken and adds it to the archive details. Read once at capture time; no background tracking.";
"NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription" = "While \"Also save to the system album\" is on (the default), a copy of each photo and video is saved to your photo library. You can turn this off in Settings.";
